# Everything is left out, then what the Edx hosts need is let in.
*

!NuGet.Config
!common.props
!common.versions.props
!src/**
!samples/Directory.Build.props
!samples/Directory.Packages.props
!samples/edx/**

# what a build or a run leaves (the back office is built outside, see Dockerfile.back-office)
**/bin
**/obj
**/Logs
samples/edx/app/back-office
# the XSD of the e-invoice packages are part of the build of Edx.Shared.Efatura; the rest of docs is not
samples/edx/docs/python
samples/edx/docs/samples
samples/edx/docs/zips

# secrets: the private key is a secret of the auth server, mounted at run time
**/private_key.xml
